This repository contains the source code of the data-extraction and review application
used in the associated systematic review and meta-analysis. It is made publicly visible
solely so that the extraction workflow can be inspected.

Permission is granted to view the contents of this repository and to download and run
the unmodified code for the sole purpose of inspecting the workflow described in the
associated article.

